# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          -- 50 chars, imperative, no trailing period
#
# <body>                              -- what changed and WHY, wrap at 72
#
# <footer>                            -- Refs: #123 / BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TYPE
#   feat      new capability
#   fix       bug fix
#   refactor  behaviour-preserving restructure
#   perf      performance
#   style     formatting / design tokens only
#   docs      documentation
#   test      tests
#   build     deps, bundler, tsconfig, turbo
#   chore     tooling, housekeeping
#
# SCOPE  -- the workspace package, so `git log --grep` finds it fast
#   apps:      atlas | nova | pulse
#   packages:  types | config | api | storage | core | ui
#   tooling:   eslint | tsconfig | tailwind
#   repo:      deps | ci | release
#
# EXAMPLES
#   feat(atlas): add hero banner to home
#   fix(ui): keep switch knob inside its track
#   feat(api): resolve US content ratings from TMDb
#   build(deps): pin typescript to 6.x for eslint compatibility
#
# BRANCHES     atlas/<topic>   nova/<topic>   pulse/<topic>   core/<topic>
# TAGS         v<x.y.z>  (repo)      <app>-v<x.y.z>  (per app)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
